# Design

- Default layout is 12 DOF (3 per leg). Size and mass must fit Pi 5 + AI HAT+ + battery + camera.
- Do not copy other quadrupeds' CAD. Cite Mini Pupper / SpotMicro / Pupper as references only.
- License for releasing design files is TBD (ADR-0003). Do not add a LICENSE that contradicts that ADR.
- Prefer documenting joint limits, MG995 horn standards, and cable routing before generating meshes. v1 CAD is MG995; do not block on ST3215.
